  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_header.webp\" alt=\"标题\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_promo.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_description.webp\" alt=\"描述\"></p>\n<p><strong>复古动画</strong> 重构了砍伐、挖掘、拾取和耕作等基本动作的动画。该模组非常适合为游戏增添<strong>沉浸感</strong>和<strong>角色扮演机制</strong>。动画灵感来源于游戏Vintage Story中的动画。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_compatibility.webp\" alt=\"兼容性\"></p>\n<p>如果一个模组未标记为兼容，仍有可能正常工作。如果无法正常工作，请报告问题，我会尝试为其添加兼容性支持。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更好的战斗 ✅</li>\n<li>第一人称模型 ✅</li>\n<li>真实相机 ✅</li>\n<li>史诗战斗 ❌</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Vintage_Animations/MP_VintageAnimations_showcase.webp\" alt=\"展示\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fRaub0R2ezv0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/Raub0R2ezv0</a></p>",
